  tokenizeString.ts, matcher.ts and theme.ts, in TextMateGrammar.swift, TextMateTokenizer.swift,
  ScopeSelector.swift and SyntaxTheme.swift.
- vscode-oniguruma, https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-oniguruma @ 1e38f9612a2599529cfa54283dd419bad697de23,
  MIT, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation: the scanner's search cache and its use of Oniguruma's RegSet, in
  TextMateRegex.swift.
- Visual Studio Code, https://github.com/microsoft/vscode @ 08e8bbfca63e53b57005f10e97b0fa19f2cf81f1, MIT,
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation:
  - glob.ts (parseRegExp, starsToRegExp) in PathGlob.swift; languagesAssociations.ts and languagesRegistry.ts
