  - guidesTextModelPart.ts and model/utils.ts (indent guides), in IndentGuides.swift;
    cursorTypeEditOperations.ts and cursorDeleteOperations.ts (closing pairs), in AutoClosing.swift; the word
    separators of wordHelper.ts, in Occurrences.swift.

